<?php if (in_array($st, ['invoice_issued', 'awaiting_payment'], true) && $can['request'] && $due > 0) : ?><div class="panel"><h2>Collect online with Razorpay</h2><p class="muted">Still due: <?= e(money($due)) ?>. Type the amount to collect (all of it, or part) and the client pays it by QR or in Razorpay's checkout window. The payment is recorded here by itself once Razorpay confirms it.</p>
